{
  "scenario": "Generate an IZ with amount, currency and description per invoice.",
  "source": "open-api.json + verified live on TEST 2026-10-24 (docs/api-notes.md)",
  "notes": [
    "payment needs both amount and currency (ISO 4217). description is at most 512 characters."
